evice in it. I got the idea from that fairy tale where the big bad wolf disguised itself as Grandma!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","015","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Hmm... So with this, I can change my voice?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["obj","qstory_side_140_004",1,null,null],["chd",0,4,"avg1_140","b","006","star"],["say","avg1_140","That's right. Just turn the dial, and you can make your voice as deep or as high as you want.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_140","b","009","idea",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_140","And if you turn it all the way to the right, it turns into a cat's meow. All the way to the left, and it becomes a dog's bark.",0,""],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["chd",1,4,"avg1_140","a","002",null],["mrt",1,"z","022",null,null],["say","avg3_100","That actually sounds pretty fun. Let me try it.==W== First I'll turn it to the right...",1,""],["w",1.0],["se","se_138"],["cbg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5,null,null,"youchupeng"],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","003",null,null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_275"],["mrt",2,"z","011",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Meow~",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_138"],["cbg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"zuochupeng"],["w",1.5],["se","se_155"],["mrt",2,"z","026",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Woof!",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["mrt",2,"z","013","exclamation",null],["say","avg3_100","Hahaha! Oh my, this is so much fun!",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["objx"],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,null,1.0,"OutSine",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm","m49"],["show","avg1_140","b","006",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_140","b",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_140","Right?==W== But the client said, \"Who needs a feature that turns your voice into animal noises?\" And then they returned it.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_140","b","013","awkward",null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_140","b","003",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_140","So the moment I delivered the order, I blocked them. And I'm keeping this for myself.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_140","b",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["obj","qstory_tales_05_002",0,null,null],["mrt",1,"z","002","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","So the others are like that, too?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_140","b","006",null,0.65,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["say","avg1_140","All of these are inventions that got returned because of the design or the unrecognized extra features.",0,""],["w",0.5],["objx"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_140","b",null,"music",0.55,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_140","But you know, since they've been returned, maybe they'll meet someone who can appreciate what makes them special.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","023",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Hehe, that's so true.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_140","b","009","exclamation",null,-0.35,1.5,null,"diantou2","Linear",0.3],["say","avg1_140","Also! The invention in that box was inspired by Alicia's Underground Adventure—",0,""],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["se","se_069"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_140","b","012",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_140","Ah...",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","013","happy",null],["say","avg3_100","Haha, maybe we should eat first. We can look at the rest of the inventions later.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["se","se_389"],["bg","BG_Black",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.5],["mrt",1,"y","009","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","...==W== The meal's over. But it looks like I'm not leaving the workshop anytime soon.",2,""],["w",1.0],["bgm","m44"],["mrt",0,"y","020",null,null],["goon"],["mrt",0,"y","021","sweaty",null],["say","avg3_100","She did say she can't make progress unless she's looking at my face while she works...==W== Well, whatever. At this point, I'm used to being stared at.",2,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"y","010",null,null],["goon"],["bg","workshop_lab_night",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"y","011","idea",null],["say","avg3_100","Just sitting here doing nothing feels a little silly. Maybe I'll take a look at Tyrant Pie's design.",2,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_077"],["obj","qstory_side_140_003_FP",0,null,null],["w",1.0],["mrt",2,"z","011","love",null],["say","avg3_100","Not bad, not bad. It does look pretty cute...==W== Hmm...",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","015",null,null],["goon"],["mrt",0,"z","015","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","But ...==W== isn't it kind of small? It's only half the size of Rabbit Pie's hat.",1,""],["w",1.0],["mrt",0,"z","002","attention",null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["objx"],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_140","b","002",0.6,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_140","b",null,"happy",0.55,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_140","It may be small, but I'm planning to make it the strongest automaton I've ever built. What I'm trying to do now is to see how tiny I can make it without cutting any of the core functions.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_140","b","003",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_140","Eventually I want to make it even smaller...==W== Ideally, small enough to carry around in a coat pocket.",0,""],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_140","b","009","idea",null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_140","b","003","shy",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_140","Tiny and portable, so you can keep it on you all the time and snuggle with it whenever you want. Heehee~",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",2,"z","002","idea",null],["say","avg3_100","Then it'd be nice if it also had cooling and warming functions.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","011","music",null],["say","avg3_100","You could adjust its temperature depe